Good point.  I have tried many times to understand why Nethack is stored
in about 30 different .tar.Z files, and failed.  'tar' doesn't accept
wildcards as tarfile names, so if you don't use the provided script,
or if your system can't use it for some reason, you either have to do
everything one at a time, or write a shell script of your own.  
